From 5ebeead18514ca6e23c39f0222f4a414d1a2feaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VideoPlayerGold snapshot <jestar001@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:01:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vf_vr2d: VR180/VR360 to a flat view, GPU resident (CUDA)

One eye of a stereo VR frame is reprojected through a virtual camera in
CUDA memory, before any upscaler, so vf_nvvfx VSR enlarges only the part
of the frame that is on screen. Kernels embedded as PTX, checked against
ffmpeg v360. Live view through vf-command (view/yaw/pitch/fov/eye/...).
